{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for SaveEase', 'description': "This container represents the core mobile application for SaveEase, a cross-platform micro-savings app targeting low-income users. It orchestrates all user-facing features, including onboarding, savings, goals, withdrawals, gamification, security, and settings. The container is responsible for:\n\n- Delivering a seamless, accessible, and mobile-first user experience.\n- Managing all business logic for micro-savings, goal tracking, withdrawals, and gamification.\n- Ensuring robust security, privacy, and compliance with data protection standards.\n- Providing offline-first capabilities, local data persistence, and reliable sync.\n- Supporting modular feature development for future extensibility (e.g., backend/payment integrations).\n\nIt interacts with simulated external services for authentication and payments in the MVP, and with local storage for offline support. The container is designed for lightweight performance, accessibility, and easy maintenance, aligning with the project's non-functional requirements.", 'framework': 'flutter', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "User Onboarding",\n      "description": "Simple registration via phone/email, optional KYC with secure document upload.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Savings Mechanism",\n      "description": "Round-up and scheduled micro-savings, track total saved, and support for goal-based saving.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Withdrawals",\n      "description": "Users can withdraw savings anytime, with an \'Emergency Reason\' field.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Savings Goals",\n      "description": "Set and track multiple savings goals with progress bars and optional deadlines/reminders.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Gamification",\n      "description": "Streaks for consistent saving and visual badges for milestones.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Security",\n      "description": "PIN or biometric login, all user data encrypted in transit and at rest.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Simple UI/UX",\n      "description": "Mobile-first, accessible fonts, large buttons, minimal screens, colorful and encouraging visuals.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Offline Support & Localization",\n      "description": "Works with intermittent internet and supports multiple languages (RTL optional).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "Flutter"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2E7D32",\n    "secondary": "#F9A825",\n    "accent": "#00B8D4"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app opens with a simple onboarding flow (registration, optional KYC). The home dashboard shows total savings, active goals (with progress bars), and quick actions (save, withdraw). A bottom navigation bar provides access to Home, Goals, Withdraw, and Settings. Each goal has a detail screen with progress, reminders, and history. The withdrawal screen collects amount and emergency reason. Settings allow PIN/biometric setup, language selection, and account management. UI uses large buttons, accessible fonts, and colorful visuals for encouragement."\n}'}",
